            "detailed_description": "Army Men II, the sequel to the best-selling title Army Men, takes plastic toy soldier warfare into the kitchen, bedroom, front yard, and garage. Once again Sarge will lead his heroic Green forces into head-melting, plastic-body-part-exploding, combat mayhem; only this time the battle is for control of the kitchen sink!<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Crazy weapons: magnifying glasses and spray cans complement your traditional arsenal.<br></li><li>Plastic warfare's finest hour: nothing's as fun as melting Tan troops into puddles of plastic!<br></li><li>The kitchen campaigns: toy soldier warfare moves to the kitchen, bedroom, front yard, and garage!</li></ul>",
